{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single-player, Turn-based Strategy, 3D, Board Game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Authentically recreates the Korean War based on historical data, including battle scenes, military units, equipment systems, and AI strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Due to the game's massive scale, we've divided the Korean War campaigns into multiple DLCs for player convenience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The base game includes all functionalities but only contains the <strong>[Battle of Unsan]</strong> level, which is the first mission of the First Campaign in <i>&quot;Dongyu Dangkou Zhi \u00b7 Korean War&quot;</i>, priced at <strong>$1.99</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Subsequent DLCs will be released sequentially:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chinese Hit</strong> (4 additional levels)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Funchilin Bridge</strong>(10 levels)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Occupy Seoul</strong> (4 levels)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Butcher's Action</strong> (7 levels)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Swing</strong> (7 levels)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chorwon</strong> (6 levels)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1951 UN Summer Offensive</strong> (8 levels)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1951 UN Autumn Offensive</strong> (4 levels)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1952 Chinese Autumn Counterattack</strong> (7 levels)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1952 Battle of Triangle Hill</strong> (3 levels)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1953 Chinese Summer Counterattack</strong> (5 levels)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1953 Battle of Kimpo</strong> (1 level)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Last Battle</strong>(1 level)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pricing follows a <strong>\u226415 cents/hour</strong> ratio with escalating discounts (30%-70%). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>Complete Edition Bundle</strong> with all DLCs will be offered at an additional <strong>90% discount</strong>.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3349750?t=1758071502","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3349750?t=1758071502","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349750/5aec9cfaeb800251f5f1c3df7437ad3fb932f593/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758071502","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349750/5aec9cfaeb800251f5f1c3df7437ad3fb932f593/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758071502","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single-player, Turn-based Strategy, 3D, Board Game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Authentically recreates the Korean War based on historical data, including battle scenes, military units, equipment systems, and AI strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Due to the game's massive scale, we've divided the Korean War campaigns into multiple DLCs for player convenience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The base game includes all functionalities but only contains the <strong>[Battle of Unsan]</strong> level, which is the first mission of the First Campaign in <i>&quot;Dongyu Dangkou Zhi \u00b7 Korean War&quot;</i>, priced at <strong>$1.99</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Subsequent DLCs will be released sequentially:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chinese Hit</strong> (4 additional levels)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Funchilin Bridge</strong>(10 levels)<